1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 21=

8
00:00:47,759 --> 00:00:49,200
High-ridge deep tillage

9
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:50,500
maintains soil fertility,

10
00:00:50,979 --> 00:00:51,979
drought- and flood-proof.

11
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:54,159
If promoted countywide,

12
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:56,799
it could yield results
by next spring plowing.

13
00:01:01,899 --> 00:01:02,899
Lord Liang,

14
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:06,219
without heart in it,

15
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:08,060
a thousand good strategies

16
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:09,700
are but in vain.

17
00:01:09,799 --> 00:01:12,599
Master Zhao,
tomorrow is Yingnan's wedding day.

18
00:01:12,799 --> 00:01:13,900
I really cannot wait.

19
00:01:14,340 --> 00:01:15,340
All is prepared.

20
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:17,760
Today, I will storm the Zhu Mansion

21
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:19,439
and save Yingnan at all costs.

22
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,000
If I fail,

23
00:01:21,079 --> 00:01:22,700
even if I die with her,

24
00:01:23,340 --> 00:01:25,340
I will have no regrets.

25
00:01:27,299 --> 00:01:28,799
Foolhardy courage.

26
00:01:29,799 --> 00:01:30,819
My heart is burning.

27
00:01:31,719 --> 00:01:32,719
What

28
00:01:32,739 --> 00:01:33,739
matter life and death

29
00:01:34,079 --> 00:01:35,079
at a time like this?

30
00:01:35,239 --> 00:01:38,379
Yingnan must be suffering right now.

31
00:01:39,819 --> 00:01:41,840
Master Zhao, you have vast powers.

32
00:01:42,180 --> 00:01:43,599
Please show me a way out.

33
00:01:45,879 --> 00:01:46,879
Very well.

34
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:50,019
Today, I shall write a marriage pact
across three lifetimes

35
00:01:50,519 --> 00:01:52,219
for you and Miss Zhu.

36
00:01:56,686 --> 00:01:57,926
(Marriage Pact)

37
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:00,920
Master Zhao,

38
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:05,180
why is this marriage pact
written on yellow talisman paper,

39
00:02:05,519 --> 00:02:08,520
and the hour is midnight tomorrow?

40
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:11,340
But Yingnan will be wed
at noon tomorrow...

41
00:02:11,340 --> 00:02:13,280
If you trust me, ask no questions.

42
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,400
Keep this pact safe.

43
00:02:16,060 --> 00:02:17,099
Tomorrow midnight,

44
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,550
wear your wedding robes.

45
00:02:18,550 --> 00:02:20,210
Burn it 9 miles west of the city,

46
00:02:20,210 --> 00:02:22,759
beneath the locust tree
on the rocky mound.

47
00:02:23,099 --> 00:02:24,099
Remember.

48
00:02:25,039 --> 00:02:27,039
You must be sincere

49
00:02:27,340 --> 00:02:28,340
and stay focused.

50
00:02:29,039 --> 00:02:30,759
Think only of your bond with Miss Zhu,

51
00:02:31,460 --> 00:02:32,560
and all shall be revealed.

52
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:35,400
Master, will this truly work?

53
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:37,620
Is there anything else I need to do?

54
00:02:53,266 --> 00:02:58,451
♪To forget it is to set it free♪

55
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:03,607
♪The cocoon of love shatters like snow♪

56
00:03:04,883 --> 00:03:10,163
♪Unable to sever
greed, wrath, and desire♪

57
00:03:10,163 --> 00:03:16,714
♪Where letting go
reveals moonlit streams♪

58
00:03:40,066 --> 00:03:45,144
♪Ink stains, memory chains♪

59
00:03:45,914 --> 00:03:50,299
♪Black hair cut, wounds laid bare♪

60
00:03:51,844 --> 00:03:56,828
♪A dying lamp, a shattered view♪

61
00:03:57,637 --> 00:04:02,539
♪Barely escaped,
yet trapped in love's trial again♪

62
00:04:04,539 --> 00:04:05,539
Heaven above,

63
00:04:06,139 --> 00:04:08,659
I, Liang Shanbo,
offer my heart's blood as betrothal,

64
00:04:08,900 --> 00:04:10,360
(Marriage Pact)
wishing to take Zhu Yingnan as my wife.

65
00:04:10,599 --> 00:04:11,620
Unchanging in heart,

66
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:12,960
unfaltering in love,

67
00:04:13,319 --> 00:04:14,439
for all eternity.

68
00:04:15,178 --> 00:04:20,951
♪To forget it is to set it free♪

69
00:04:20,951 --> 00:04:25,922
♪The cocoon of love shatters like snow♪

70
00:04:26,835 --> 00:04:31,880
♪Unable to sever
greed, wrath, and desire♪

71
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:38,345
♪Where letting go
reveals moonlit streams♪

72
00:04:38,741 --> 00:04:43,931
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

73
00:04:47,639 --> 00:04:48,639
Yingnan...

74
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:53,720
Yingnan,

75
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:57,459
how could you leave me all alone
in this world?

76
00:04:57,759 --> 00:04:59,199
How could they be so cruel,

77
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,420
forcing you to death?

78
00:05:01,939 --> 00:05:02,939
Yingnan...

79
00:05:02,939 --> 00:05:03,939
Hand in hand we walk,

80
00:05:04,199 --> 00:05:05,199
side by side we grow old.

81
00:05:05,500 --> 00:05:06,839
That was our promise.

82
00:05:07,660 --> 00:05:09,779
If we cannot share a bed in life,

83
00:05:10,279 --> 00:05:12,480
we shall share a grave in death.

84
00:05:13,379 --> 00:05:14,379
I'm coming with you.

85
00:05:15,180 --> 00:05:16,180
Shanbo.

86
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,600
With yellow paper as pledge,

87
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,160
I bridge life and death.

88
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:25,399
What I seal is your bond
across three lifetimes.

89
00:05:25,779 --> 00:05:26,779
This life's bond is thin.

90
00:05:27,139 --> 00:05:28,199
The fault is not yours

91
00:05:28,819 --> 00:05:29,839
but the world's.

92
00:05:30,540 --> 00:05:32,100
Zhu Yingnan's soul hasn't wandered far.

93
00:05:32,399 --> 00:05:34,000
I've already guided her
to reincarnation.

94
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:36,560
A bond across three lifetimes?

95
00:05:36,899 --> 00:05:37,899
Exactly.

96
00:05:38,379 --> 00:05:39,379
Sixteen years from now,

97
00:05:39,500 --> 00:05:40,500
in Huangxi Town,

98
00:05:40,579 --> 00:05:41,579
Huainan Circuit.

99
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:42,720
The daughter

100
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:44,480
of the Liu family

101
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:51,920
named Nianqing

102
00:05:52,439 --> 00:05:53,980
will be Zhu Yingnan's reincarnation.

103
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:56,379
She will be born
with fragments of memories of you,

104
00:05:56,759 --> 00:05:58,800
waiting to reunite with you.

105
00:05:59,220 --> 00:06:00,220
Huangxi Town...

106
00:06:01,500 --> 00:06:02,500
Nianqing...

107
00:06:03,319 --> 00:06:04,319
Master,

108
00:06:04,939 --> 00:06:05,939
is this truly real?

109
00:06:07,339 --> 00:06:08,560
Absolutely true.

110
00:06:09,180 --> 00:06:11,939
But in these sixteen years,
you must become strong

111
00:06:12,779 --> 00:06:13,939
and make a name for yourself.

112
00:06:14,519 --> 00:06:15,699
When you reunite,

113
00:06:16,139 --> 00:06:18,800
you must have the power
to shield her from the storm

114
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:20,180
and protect her for life,

115
00:06:20,639 --> 00:06:21,920
so that family status

116
00:06:22,379 --> 00:06:23,420
and oppressive power

117
00:06:24,500 --> 00:06:26,079
will never stand between you again.

118
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:29,839
Yingnan, rest assured.

119
00:06:29,839 --> 00:06:32,560
In sixteen years, I will definitely
find you in Huangxi Town.

120
00:06:33,759 --> 00:06:35,680
I will stand tall and proud.

121
00:06:36,139 --> 00:06:38,759
When that day comes, I will never
let you suffer any grievance.

122
00:06:39,180 --> 00:06:41,439
Good. Remember your resolution today,

123
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,660
and strive to change this world.

124
00:06:43,819 --> 00:06:47,980
At least, let the lovers of this world
decide their own fate.

125
00:06:58,399 --> 00:06:59,399
Dong,

126
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:03,399
will Liu Nianqing in sixteen years
truly be Zhu Yingnan?

127
00:07:04,060 --> 00:07:05,060
Do you hope so?

128
00:07:05,379 --> 00:07:06,800
Of course, I do.

129
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:10,360
I wish we could
jump sixteen years ahead right now

130
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:13,000
to see the joy
of their long-awaited reunion.

131
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,199
When you were born, I was not yet born.

132
00:07:16,540 --> 00:07:18,199
When I was born, you were already old.

133
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:22,339
By then,
Liu Nianqing will only be sixteen,

134
00:07:22,500 --> 00:07:23,579
but Lord Liang...

135
00:07:25,660 --> 00:07:29,360
I wonder if other unexpected obstacles
will arise.

136
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:33,040
Unexpected obstacles are also trials.

137
00:07:33,519 --> 00:07:35,959
Only through tribulations
can true devotion

138
00:07:36,259 --> 00:07:37,259
shine all the brighter.

139
00:07:39,319 --> 00:07:40,319
Let us head back.

140
00:07:40,579 --> 00:07:41,579
Cuicui

141
00:07:42,300 --> 00:07:43,300
should be back soon.

142
00:07:54,839 --> 00:07:55,839
Wan'er,

143
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,740
Dong has been gone so long.

144
00:07:58,300 --> 00:07:59,680
Could something have happened?

145
00:07:59,819 --> 00:08:01,819
Yan, don't be afraid.

146
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,480
I believe in him.

147
00:08:17,279 --> 00:08:18,879
This celestial phenomenon is terrifying.

148
00:08:19,699 --> 00:08:22,319
Why isn't there any sound inside?

149
00:08:22,879 --> 00:08:25,060
Dong will be fine, right?

150
00:08:25,060 --> 00:08:26,939
Yan, don't be afraid.

151
00:08:27,019 --> 00:08:28,160
We have to trust Dong.

152
00:08:28,459 --> 00:08:29,459
He said

153
00:08:29,699 --> 00:08:30,899
he could bring Cuicui back,

154
00:08:31,079 --> 00:08:32,079
so he definitely can.

155
00:08:32,980 --> 00:08:36,720
This must be the tribulation
brought on by defying Heaven.

156
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:39,620
But Dong will surely pull through.

157
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,299
It's so cold.

158
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:23,631
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

159
00:09:23,631 --> 00:09:26,418
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

160
00:09:26,994 --> 00:09:29,156
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

161
00:09:29,156 --> 00:09:32,002
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

162
00:09:32,002 --> 00:09:35,280
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

163
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:36,914
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

164
00:09:36,914 --> 00:09:38,978
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

165
00:09:38,978 --> 00:09:40,514
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

166
00:09:40,514 --> 00:09:43,296
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

167
00:09:43,745 --> 00:09:45,650
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

168
00:09:45,650 --> 00:09:51,681
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

169
00:09:52,263 --> 00:09:56,146
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

170
00:09:56,146 --> 00:09:59,371
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

171
00:09:59,883 --> 00:10:02,482
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

172
00:10:02,482 --> 00:10:07,610
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

173
00:10:07,610 --> 00:10:11,138
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

174
00:10:11,138 --> 00:10:14,846
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

175
00:10:14,846 --> 00:10:16,738
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

176
00:10:16,738 --> 00:10:18,815
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

177
00:10:18,815 --> 00:10:21,346
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

178
00:10:21,346 --> 00:10:25,383
♪You met the most precious person♪

179
00:10:27,051 --> 00:10:28,914
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

180
00:10:28,914 --> 00:10:31,433
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

181
00:10:31,433 --> 00:10:32,882
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

182
00:10:32,882 --> 00:10:35,184
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

183
00:10:35,184 --> 00:10:37,154
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

184
00:10:37,154 --> 00:10:41,564
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

185
00:10:41,564 --> 00:10:43,106
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

186
00:10:43,106 --> 00:10:45,016
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

187
00:10:45,016 --> 00:10:48,290
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

188
00:10:48,290 --> 00:10:51,611
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

189
00:10:51,611 --> 00:10:53,346
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

190
00:10:53,346 --> 00:10:57,970
♪Just catch your breath first♪

191
00:10:57,970 --> 00:11:01,720
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

192
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:05,098
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

193
00:11:05,472 --> 00:11:07,442
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

194
00:11:07,442 --> 00:11:13,189
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

195
00:11:13,189 --> 00:11:16,705
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

196
00:11:16,705 --> 00:11:18,274
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

197
00:11:18,274 --> 00:11:20,584
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

198
00:11:20,584 --> 00:11:22,322
♪From laughter to devotion♪

199
00:11:22,322 --> 00:11:24,378
♪From falling to innocence♪

200
00:11:24,378 --> 00:11:26,226
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

201
00:11:26,226 --> 00:11:32,896
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
